{"id":"napravo","lemma":"направо","pos":"adv","rank":1324,"glosses":["to the right"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это первая дверь направо.","en":"It's the first door on the right.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"first","l":"первый"},{"g":"door"},null]},{"text":"Поверните направо, пожалуйста.","en":"Please turn right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681343","words":[{"g":"to turn, to swing","l":"повернуть"},null,{"g":"please"}]},{"text":"Иди налево, а я пойду направо.","en":"You go to the left. I'll go to the right.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"to the left"},{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},null]},{"text":"Туалет направо.","en":"The toilet is on the right.","words":[{"g":"toilet"},null]},{"text":"Поверни там направо.","en":"Turn right there.","words":[{"g":"to turn, to swing","l":"повернуть"},{"g":"there"},null]}]}